    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰχῠ-μερής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>consisting of thick</i> or
				<i>coarse parts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				100e
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				873a6
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παχυμερές</span>
			<i>the dense part</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.51U.
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -έστερον</span>, opp.
